// T61 — Cold-start minimal fixture.
//
// Smallest-possible Buff program. Used by `buff bench-cold-start` as the
// timing subject (the inline fixture in `commands/bench_cold_start.rs`
// mirrors this source byte-for-byte). Run the benchmark with:
//
//     buff bench-cold-start
//
// Build + run this file directly with:
//
//     buff run examples/cold_start_minimal.buff
//
// The program prints a single line + exits. Cold-start time (process
// spawn → first byte on stdout) is the metric of interest.

func main():
    print("hello")
